== A node with no design with c'u >= 0 (panel(17, p=6), size 3, control 0 fixed out)
   off the face Clarabel reports infeasible with no point; the first build's face solve raised a TypeError lifting
   the point that was not returned; it now reports infeasible with no point, as off the face. size_certificate
   closes the node at its dual tier on and off the face, before any solve.
   over 2,400 face solves on panel(seed, p), seeds 0-59, p 5-6, every size, four fixings: 13 such nodes (26 solves);
   on the rest every Shor solve is optimal (1,187 of 1,187), full solves 1,137 optimal and 50 optimal_inaccurate,
   and the gap between the exact bound at the solve's multipliers and its value is at most 3.1e-7 of the objective's
   scale at either level and status

